# 01-facility-a.env - Facility A's answers. ONE HOME PER ANSWER: the block in 01-facility-a.md and the whole of
# 01-facility-a.drawio are generated from this file by facility-design.py.
#   what-if, writes nothing:  python3 docs/facility-setups/facility-design.py show 01-facility-a SITE_HA=S1
#   change one, rebuild:      python3 docs/facility-setups/facility-design.py set  01-facility-a SITE_HA=M1
#   walk what is open:        python3 docs/facility-setups/facility-design.py ask  01-facility-a --open
# origin is PUBLIC: describe the facility by its characteristics, never its identity.
FACILITY='Facility A'

